# Dhanapal Chettiar and Company
Tamil title: தனபால் செட்டியார் கம்பெனி

*(It is only imagination! But would the lives of these people be very different? I have drawn the employer Chettiar's swagger, the worker's exhaustion, and the states of mind on both sides as they exist. Capture life's conditions as a picture and examine them: even cartloads of books will not yield a lesson equal to this one.)*

## Dhanapal Chettiar's Notebook

**7 January 1940**

| Entry | Rupees-Annas-Paise |
|---|---:|
| A.M.K., interest received | 648-6-0 |
| Shop rent received from Kalinga Naidu | 68-0-0 |
| Cart fare | 0-6-0 |
| Clerk Kumaran, debit | 5-0-0 |
| Medicine for the household | 22-0-0 |
| Priest Lokamirtha, for *panchamirtha* ablution | 75-0-0 |
| Lawyer Sundaram Iyer, debit | 32-0-0 |
| Watchman Kandan, debit | 2-8-0 |
| Oranges | 1-8-0 |
| Ambika Hotel expense | 2-8-0 |
| **Total receipts** | **716-6-0** |
| **Expenses** | **140-14-0** |
| **Balance** | **575-8-0** |

Dhanapal Chettiar lent money at interest and rented out many houses for income. The account above is information supplied one day by his notebook.

